Package: TreeCalcs
Type: Package
Title: Fast Tree Permutations, Traversals, and Aggregations in C++20
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tim Becker", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tim@the-beckers.net")
Description: Efficient tree algorithms powered by C++20 concepts and Rcpp,
    including tree permutation, propagation, folding, leaf traversal, and
    hierarchical tree-structured Shapley values (cShapley) implementing the
    methodology of Li, Naldi, Nisen, and Shi (2016) "Organising the allocation".
    Supports native data.tree Node objects and standard nested R lists.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.0)
Suggests:
    data.tree,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
LinkingTo: 
    Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++20
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
